# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `storage/` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, which silently excluded src/server/modules/storage from the
# repository. The build passed locally off the working tree and failed only once a clean
# checkout was built. This pattern is meant to exclude the local attachment directory at
# the project root, nothing else.
/storage/
*.log
.DS_Store
src/generated/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
